00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
What was actually tested? At handover, a finding must lead back to its evidence.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
One engagement. One assessment. Scope, observations and retest stay together.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A 403 alone proves little. Protected content and valid controls establish disclosure in this archived case.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Three exports. Five source records. One outside scope. The scanner hint remains a hint.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Purple loop concept. Record the expected signal, supplied telemetry and validation gap separately.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Two baseline findings. One fix_verified. The other stays not_retested.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Both verifiers accepted the original. Both rejected the copy after a one-byte change.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
AuthzLedger. Pilot on stable v1.5.0. Thirty days, two users, one authorised engagement. CHF 2,400.

